+ thesis_and_content: Thesis/Content (25%) - Original, defensible thesis with sustained critical thinking and meaningful deductions.
+ organization_and_structure: Organization/Structure (25%) - Purposeful structure with strong progression, clear transitions, and a conclusion that extends thinking.
+ evidence_and_support: Evidence/Support (20%) - Precise, well-integrated evidence that deepens analysis and builds authority.
+ voice_and_style: Voice/Style (20%) - Authentic voice with engaging, precise language and consistent tone.
+ grammar_and_mechanics: Grammar/Syntax/Formatting (10%) - Technical correctness and polished presentation that support clarity.
